OL,3,GNEWSADrug-driving arrest after
OL,4,Amotorcyclist dies in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fmotorcyclist died following a crash on
OL,8,Fa main route into Southampton city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FThe crash, involving a black Citroen C4
OL,12,Fand blue Triumph motorcycle, happened
OL,13,Fon The Avenue at the junction of
OL,14,FHighfield Avenue on Tuesday at about
OL,15,F18:40 GMT.
OL,17,FHampshire Police said the motorcyclist,
OL,18,Fa man in his 30s from Southampton, died
OL,19,Fat the scene.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
