OL,3,GNEWSADrug-driving arrest after
OL,4,Amotorcyclist dies in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said a 24-year-old man from
OL,7,FSouthampton had been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of drug driving and causing
OL,9,Fdeath by careless driving. He remains
OL,10,Fin custody.
